  #line-at(49.56pt, 653.38pt, "driven thermal disturbance [52]. For a periodically modulated heat source under the Fourier-diffusion approximation, ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 668.98pt, "the characteristic penetration depth of the thermal disturbance can be expressed as: ")
