  #line-at(49.56pt, 559.75pt, "jointly by sample architecture, target thermophysical properties, characteristic heat-diffusion scales, available prior ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 575.38pt, "information, and acceptable experimental complexity. The different thermoreflectance techniques therefore do not form ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 590.98pt, "an absolute hierarchy of performance; rather, their applicability depends on whether the accessible observables provide ")
