  #line-at(49.56pt, 700.18pt, "such systems, the quasi-steady temperature rise reflects the combined thermal resistance and heat-spreading behavior ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 715.78pt, "within the sampled region, and the inverse problem can remain relatively well constrained when contributions from ")
