  #line-at(49.56pt, 68.28pt, "thermoreflectance signal, and a single experimental condition rarely provides sufficient independent constraints on all ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 83.9pt, "three. TDTR, D-TOPS, and micromachined electrothermal techniques have provided an important basis for studying ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 100.22pt, "in-plane and cross-plane transport; the SPS example demonstrates a feasible route for joint estimation of ")
