  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(56.28pt, 115.1pt, " on a single platform through broadband periodic-waveform measurements. This capability is relevant to thermal ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 130.7pt, "design of flexible electronics, heat dissipation in polymer packaging, and studies of thermal-management mechanisms ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 146.3pt, "in process-sensitive functional films. The same principle of adding independent constraints can also be implemented ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 161.9pt, "using multifrequency or multispot TDTR, BO-TDTR/FDTR, or cross-platform measurements; the essential ")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 177.5pt, "requirement is that the observations contain enough information to distinguish the target parameters. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#0000ff"))
  #line-at(49.56pt, 551.35pt, "Figure 6  Simultaneous extraction of in-plane thermal conductivity, cross-plane thermal conductivity, and volumetric heat ")
