  #set text(font: "Cambria Math", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(73.704pt, 668.5pt, "|")
  #set text(font: "SimSun", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(76.944pt, 668.98pt, "接近于零，则表明信号对该参数变化不敏感，")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 684.58pt, "仅依靠当前实验条件难以获取可靠估值。")
  #line-at(70.584pt, 700.18pt, "然而，较大的单参数敏感性并不必然意味着该参")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 715.78pt, "数能够被独立反演。对于多参数问题，更关键的是不")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 731.38pt, "同参数对实验信号的影响是否能够相互区分。当两个")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 747pt, "或多个参数的敏感性曲线在时间域、频率域或空间域")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 762.6pt, "中具有高度相似的变化趋势时，它们对测量信号产生")
  #line-at(49.56pt, 778.2pt, "的影响近似相关，参数之间将出现较强耦合，反演问")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 458.35pt, "题也随之表现出明显的不适定性。此时，即使原始实")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 473.95pt, "验信号具有较高的信噪比，微小的测量误差、模型误")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 489.55pt, "差或先验参数不确定度仍可能在反演过程中被显著")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 505.15pt, "放大，导致待测热物性的不确定度增加。因此，敏感")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 520.75pt, "性分析需要同时回答两个问题：一是目标参数对实验")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 536.35pt, "信号是否具有足够大的响应，即参数是否")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(496.06pt, 536.35pt, "“")
  #set text(font: "SimSun", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(500.74pt, 536.35pt, "可测")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(521.74pt, 536.35pt, "”")
  #set text(font: "SimSun", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(526.3pt, 536.35pt, "；二")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 551.95pt, "是目标参数与其他未知参数的响应特征能否有效区")
  #line-at(308.35pt, 567.55pt, "分，即参数是否")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(381.91pt, 567.55pt, "“")
  #set text(font: "SimSun", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(386.59pt, 567.55pt, "可分离")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(418.18pt, 567.55pt, "”")
  #set text(font: "SimSun", size: 10.56pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(422.74pt, 567.55pt, "。")
